        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Gemini &mdash; 3rd (Cloth Ability) Technique, gained at level 11.</em></p><p><em>A galaxy's birth compressed into a fist.</em></p><p>Each creature in the area takes @Damage[6d8[force]] damage with a basic Reflex save. The area becomes difficult terrain for 1 minute as space folds in on itself.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The damage increases by 1d8.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
